abstract: "A search engine for expansion microscopy experiments extracted from the literature: 381 studies, 6,755 rows, 301 species, 1,483 primary antibodies and 608 dyes and stains, with an offline single-file portal, the full extraction pipeline, logs, quality controls and a paper-by-paper provenance record."
